description: "Query: clickbench_q22"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: c DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   Projection: hits.SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1)) AS c                                                                                                                  |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.SearchPhrase]], aggr=[[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))]]                                                                                                 |
|               |       Filter: CAST(hits.SearchPhrase AS Utf8View) != Utf8View("") AND CAST(hits.URL AS LargeUtf8) LIKE LargeUtf8("%google%")                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[URL, SearchPhrase], partial_filters=[CAST(hits.SearchPhrase AS Utf8View) != Utf8View(""), CAST(hits.URL AS LargeUtf8) LIKE LargeUtf8("%google%")] |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[c@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                              |
|               |   CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     ProjectionExec: expr=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL)@1 as min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))@2 as c]                                                                   |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))]                                                               |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([SearchPhrase@0], 16), input_partitions=16                                                                                                 |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[SearchPhrase@1 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), count(Int64(1))]                                                                    |
|               |             FilterExec: CAST(SearchPhrase@1 AS Utf8View) !=  AND CAST(URL@0 AS LargeUtf8) LIKE %google%                                                                               |
|               |               RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(16), input_partitions=1                                                                                                   |
|               |                 SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |                   FallbackOnZeroResultsScanExec                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     CoalescePartitionsExec                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                       RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(16), input_partitions=1                                                                                           |
|               |                         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                           DuckSqlExec sql= SELECT "URL", "SearchPhrase" FROM "hits" WHERE (CAST("SearchPhrase" AS VARCHAR) <> '') AND CAST("URL" AS TEXT) LIKE '%google%'             |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                       |
